      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Later that night, Arkady can't sleep in his old room, he hates every piece of furniture in it, and old Klavdia Viktorovna from down the corridor tells him he's in hell now because he couldn't even steal properly. Let that be the lesson of the evening, and. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
